WEBVTT

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:59.970
Tell me somethin' jivin', I don't

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:02.200
What you know, Joe?

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.050
No Latin.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:05.530
What you know, Joe?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.610
Ain't hi-hattin'.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:08.670
What you know, Joe?

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.790
I ain't foolin'.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.350
I need schoolin'.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.370
I don't know.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:15.070
I don't know.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.280
Mama never told me so.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.470
Papa wouldn't let me go.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.490
Couldn't even see a movie show.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:27.930
What you know, Joe?

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:29.770
I'm just like the bear.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.160
What you know, Joe?

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.660
I ain't nowhere.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.460
What you know, Joe?

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.240
Quit your squawking.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:37.740
I ain't talking.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.140
I don't know.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:56.720
What's the matter, Butch?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.320
Oh, I feel like the fox.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:01:59.980
What you mean, Butch?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.760
man i'm beat to my socks well look isn't there something we do to get you back in the groove

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:23.940
we'll start the band jumping man you'll see me move the way i feel now it's another day

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:29.190
i feel happy again so i'll be on my way the boys are really swinging

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.930
Oh, child, now I'm we're pals. Larry, give me five.
